@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title 4.3.5 Use Cases for Admin
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

actor Admin

rectangle "Mland Operations System" {
  package "Account administration" {
    usecase "Manage User Account" as UC6
    usecase "Assign User Role" as UC7
    usecase "Lock or Unlock User Account" as UC8
  }
  package "System configuration" {
    usecase "Configure System Operational Parameters" as UC62
    usecase "Manage Third-Party API Credentials" as UC63
  }
}

Admin --> UC6
Admin --> UC7
Admin --> UC8
Admin --> UC62
Admin --> UC63

note bottom of Admin
Admin has technical and audit access only to business records
and does not replace Staff or Manager decisions.
end note
@enduml
